# Production build (Vercel, and any local `npm run build`).
#
# The frontend is served from https://astrovaniai.agoraaidemo.in and the backend
# from https://astrovani.agoraaidemo.in — separate origins, and a static host has
# no dev-server proxy, so /api calls need this absolute backend origin.
# No trailing slash, and no /api suffix: the app appends /api/... itself.
#
# Override per environment in the Vercel project's environment variables.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://astrovani.agoraaidemo.in
